=== Crossovers ===
The series' incarnation of Spider-Man makes guest appearances in ''[[Guardians of the Galaxy (TV series)|Guardians of the Galaxy]]'' and the fifth season of ''[[Avengers Assemble (TV series)|Avengers Assemble]]'', which are set in the same continuity.<ref>{{Cite tweet |number=1282760189041508352 |user=harrisonwilcox |title=Ultimate Spider-Man, Agents of SMASH, and Seasons 1-4 of Avengers are all in the same continuity. Guardians, Marvel's Spider-Man, and Black Panther's Quest are all in another continuity. |first=Harrison |last=Wilcox |date=July 13, 2020 |access-date=January 28, 2025 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20200713205429/http://twitter.com/harrisonwilcox/status/1282760189041508352 |archive-date=July 13, 2020 |url-status=dead}}</ref> Max Modell and Venom also appear in the former series, while Kraven the Hunter and Vulture appear in the latter.

