== Production ==
=== Development ===
In October 2016, the series was announced by [[Cort Alan Lane|Cort Lane]], senior vice president of Marvel Animation, as a replacement for the series' predecessor, ''[[Ultimate Spider-Man (TV series)|Ultimate Spider-Man]]'', which ended in early January 2017. ''Spider-Man'' premiered on August 19, 2017, on [[Disney XD]].<ref name=ew/><ref name="ut">{{cite web |last=Truitt |first=Brian |date=October 8, 2016 |title=Exclusive: New Spider-Man animated series coming in 2017 |url=https://www.usatoday.com/story/life/tv/2016/10/08/exclusive-new-marvel-spider-man-animated-series/91775698/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20161016195203/http://www.usatoday.com/story/life/tv/2016/10/08/exclusive-new-marvel-spider-man-animated-series/91775698/ |archive-date=October 16, 2016 |access-date=July 14, 2017 |work=[[USA Today]]}}</ref>

The show was renewed for a second season, which premiered on June 18, 2018.<ref>{{cite web |last=Yeoman |first=Kevin |date=January 24, 2018 |title=Marvel's Spider-Man Season 2 Coming in 2018 |url=https://screenrant.com/marvel-spider-man-season-2-2018-disney-xd/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180609000622/https://screenrant.com/marvel-spider-man-season-2-2018-disney-xd/ |archive-date=June 9, 2018 |access-date=January 3, 2019 |work=[[Screen Rant]]}}</ref><ref>{{cite web |last=Mueller |first=Matthew |date=March 17, 2018 |title=Avengers: Infinity War's Benedict Cumberbatch Broke A Marvel Rule To Learn The Film Is Mind-Blowingly Epic |url=http://comicbook.com/marvel/2018/03/17/avengers-infinity-war-benedict-cumberbatch-broke-marvel-rule/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180807190431/http://comicbook.com/marvel/2018/03/17/avengers-infinity-war-benedict-cumberbatch-broke-marvel-rule |archive-date=August 7, 2018 |access-date=January 3, 2019 |work=[[ComicBook.com]]}}</ref><ref>{{cite web |last=Trumbore |first=Dave |date=May 26, 2018 |title=Marvel's Spider-Man Season 2 Release Date Confirmed |url=https://collider.com/marvel-spider-man-season-2-release-date/#pockety-mortys-adult-swim-big-pixel-studios |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20190108164820/http://collider.com/marvel-spider-man-season-2-release-date#pockety-mortys-adult-swim-big-pixel-studios |archive-date=January 8, 2019 |access-date=January 3, 2019 |work=[[Collider (website)|Collider]]}}</ref> The show was subtitled '''''Maximum Venom''''' for its third season.<ref name="S3">{{Cite web |last=Boucher |first=Geoff |date=May 30, 2019 |title=Marvel's Spider-Man: DisneyXD Orders Season 3 For Spring 2020 |url=https://deadline.com/2019/05/marvels-spider-man-disneyxd-orders-season-3-for-spring-2020-1202624233/ |url-status=live |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20211122042520/https://deadline.com/2019/05/marvels-spider-man-disneyxd-orders-season-3-for-spring-2020-1202624233/ |archive-date=November 22, 2021 |access-date=May 30, 2019 |work=[[Deadline Hollywood]] |language=en}}</ref> Production on ''Maximum Venom'' started in February 2019 and ended in October 2019.{{citation needed|date=February 2021}}

